## 💊 MEDICATIONS (Admin)

### Créer un médicament

```http
POST /medications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aspirin",
  "genericName": "Acetylsalicylic Acid",
  "form": "Comprimé",
  "dosage": "500mg",
  "manufacturer": "Bayer"
}
```

### Lister tous les médicaments

```http
GET /medications
```

### Récupérer un médicament

```http
GET /medications/{id}
```

### Mettre à jour un médicament

```http
PUT /medications/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aspirin Plus",
  "dosage": "750mg"
}
```

### Supprimer un médicament

```http
DELETE /medications/{id}
```

---

## 🏥 PHARMACIES (Admin)

### Créer une pharmacie (Admin Controlled Account Creation)

```http
POST /pharmacies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pharmacie Centrale",
  "email": "contact@pharmacie-centrale.fr",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "address": {
    "street": "123 Rue de la Paix",
    "city": "Paris",
    "zipCode": "75000",
    "country": "France"
  },
  "location": {
    "latitude": 48.8566,
    "longitude": 2.3522
  },
  "phone": "0123456789"
}
```

### Lister les pharmacies (publiques: validées uniquement)

```http
GET /pharmacies
```

### Récupérer une pharmacie (publique)

```http
GET /pharmacies/{id}
```

### Mettre à jour une pharmacie

```http
PUT /pharmacies/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pharmacie Centrale Plus",
  "phone": "0987654321"
}
```

### Valider une pharmacie (Admin only)

```http
POST /pharmacies/{id}/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isValidated": true
}
```

### Supprimer une pharmacie

```http
DELETE /pharmacies/{id}
```

