## 📝 Format de réponse (OBLIGATOIRE)

### Succès

```json
{
  "status": "success",
  "code": 200,
  "message": "Description du succès",
  "data": {},
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

### Erreur

```json
{
  "status": "error",
  "code": 400,
  "message": "Description de l'erreur",
  "errors": {
    "field": ["Error message 1", "Error message 2"]
  },
  "timestamp": "2025-12-17T10:30:00Z"
}
```

